e a winning pattern.\\n        * Closed Wait: The winning tile must be a suited tile to complete a chow as the middle number. This pattern is not counted if there exists multiple tiles to complete a winning pattern.\\n        * Single Wait: The winning tile must be the tile to complete a pair. This pattern is not counted if there exists multiple tiles to complete a winning pattern.\\n        * Self Drawn: The winning tile must be drawn by the winner.\\n    Now is your turn, to your best ability, please briefly evaluate a few proimsing moves, provide reason for your final choice, and output one of the valid actions with specified format, such as Play B5.\\n        Your response format should be exactly:\\n        Evaluation: [Your Evaluation]\\n        Reason: [Your Reason]\\n        Answer: [Your Answer]\\n    \", \"user_prompt\": \"The following is the state information: The Prevailing Wind is: West Wind.Your Seat Wind is: East Wind.\\nUnshown tiles are: [W1: 2; W2: 3; W3: 3; W4: 3; W5: 4; W6: 4; W7: 3; W8: 4; W9: 3; T1: 2; T2: 3; T3: 4; T4: 3; T5: 2; T6: 1; T7: 4; T8: 4; T9: 3; B1: 2; B2: 2; B3: 2; B4: 1; B5: 1; B6: 4; B7: 2; B8: 4; B9: 3; F1: 4; F2: 4; F3: 4; F4: 2; J1: 3; J2: 2; J3: 4].\\nYour hand tiles are: [T7: 1; B1: 1; B2: 2; B7: 2; B8: 1].\\nYour melds are: [[B4, B4, B4],[B1, B2, B3]].\\nThe melds of the next player: [[B5, B5, B5]].\\nThe melds of the player sitting across: [[]].\\nThe melds of the previous player: [[B1, B2, B3]].\\nYour game history is: Play T1, Play T2, Peng B4, Play W1, Play W3, Play T5, Play T6, Chi B2, Play T6.\\nThe game history of the next player is: Play J1, Play B7, Peng B5, Play F4, Play W2, Play F4, Play J2, Play W1, Play W9.\\nThe game history of the player sitting across is: Play B9, Play T9, Play B4, Play T4, Play J2, Play T1, Play B2, Play B7.\\nThe game history of the previous player is: Play W7, Play B5, Play T5, Play T6, Play W4, Chi B2, Play B1.\\nThe followings are your valid actions:[Peng B7; Pass]\\u3002\", \"reasonin